    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sect House is a survival horror game with psychological elements and mind-bending puzzles. You play as a child whose once-happy life is shattered after your parents join a sinister cult led by a monstrous pastor. Trapped in a nightmarish home, you must explore shifting environments, solve eerie puzzles, and without falling into the hands of the pastor. Can you escape the house?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711350/extras/1632ae0670d571f9cf5d7bca441937f1.avif?t=1748807897\" width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore locations and move along the plot. Look for objects and solve puzzles in the game to move on and escape from the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Story</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various locations</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sect House is a survival horror game with psychological elements and mind-bending puzzles. You play as a child whose once-happy life is shattered after your parents join a sinister cult led by a monstrous pastor. Trapped in a nightmarish home, you must explore shifting environments, solve eerie puzzles, and without falling into the hands of the pastor. Can you escape the house?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711350/extras/1632ae0670d571f9cf5d7bca441937f1.avif?t=1748807897\" width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore locations and move along the plot. Look for objects and solve puzzles in the game to move on and escape from the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Story</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various locations</p></li></ul>",
